WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.649 --> 00:00:13.809
Ostriches can be trained to herd sheep.

00:00:13.809 --> 00:00:21.000
A hammerhead shark can be rendered completely
immobile for 15 minutes by turning it over

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:23.189
and tickling its tummy.

00:00:23.189 --> 00:00:29.390
The muscles that close a crocodile's jaws
exert a force equivalent to a truck falling

00:00:29.390 --> 00:00:36.570
off a cliff, but the muscles that open them
are so weak that they can be kept shut by

00:00:36.570 --> 00:00:38.870
a rubber band.

00:00:38.870 --> 00:00:45.690
If a tree were planted for each Coca-Cola
sold, we could reforest the Earth in three

00:00:45.690 --> 00:00:47.390
years.

00:00:47.390 --> 00:00:54.190
Placebos are 30% more effective as an antidote
for depression than drugs.

00:00:54.190 --> 00:00:59.780
Katujjiqatigiittiarnirlu is Inuktitut for
'simplicity'.

00:00:59.780 --> 00:01:07.300
The inventor of 'Best before' dates, which
were originally used for milk, was Al Capone.

00:01:07.300 --> 00:01:14.170
When playing with female puppies, male puppies
will often let them win, even if they have

00:01:14.170 --> 00:01:16.080
a physical advantage.

00:01:16.080 --> 00:01:25.250
Before the Renaissance, three-quarters of
all the books in the world were in Chinese.

00:01:25.250 --> 00:01:36.550
In 2011, the Internet reached 13.7 billion
pages: one for every year since the Big Bang.

00:01:36.550 --> 00:01:42.140
WTF is the acronym of the World Taekwondo
Federation.

00:01:42.140 --> 00:01:51.700
99% of Austrians are German, though most Austrians
insist that they aren't.

00:01:51.700 --> 00:01:59.420
Only 35% of the average person's Twitter followers
are actual people.

00:01:59.420 --> 00:02:06.050
27,000 trees are felled each day for toilet
paper.

00:02:06.050 --> 00:02:12.330
About 200,000 academic journals are published
in English each year.

00:02:12.330 --> 00:02:16.459
The average number of readers per article
is five.

00:02:16.459 --> 00:02:29.780
An adult produces enough hydrogen in their
urine each year to drive a car 2,700 kilometres.

